  "details": "The Toon Standard shader has some specular highlight issues related to whether or not a normal map is being used on a material.\n\nIf 'Use Normal Map' is not selected, specular highlights and reflections are interpolated on a per vertex basis. This behavior is unintended.\n\nHowever, if  'Use Normal Map' is selected, reflections and specular highlights will interpolate on a tangent basis instead, as is intended.",
